WEBVTT

00:02:28.353 --> 00:02:30.863
O'rta asrlarda bu materialni tarjima 
qilayotgan

00:02:30.863 --> 00:02:33.431
ispan olimlarining muammosi shunda ediki,

00:02:33.431 --> 00:02:37.913
sheen harfi va shayun so'zini ispan tilida

00:02:37.913 --> 00:02:39.863
keltirib bo'lmas edi,

00:02:39.863 --> 00:02:42.449
chunki ispan tilida 'sh' tovushi ham,

00:02:42.449 --> 00:02:43.746
'sh' harfi ham yo'q edi.

00:02:43.746 --> 00:02:45.328
Shuning uchun ular,

00:02:45.328 --> 00:02:46.994
bsohqacha yechim o'ylab topishdi,

00:02:46.994 --> 00:02:51.212
qadimgi yunon tilidan "kai" ko'rinishidagi

00:02:51.212 --> 00:02:52.960
"k" tovushini olishga

00:02:52.960 --> 00:02:55.641
qaror qilishdi.

00:02:55.641 --> 00:02:58.360
Keyinchalik, bu material umumyevropa 
tiliga,

00:02:58.360 --> 00:03:00.708
aynan lotin tiliga tarjima qilingach —